{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10011_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c1329ce8cfaa8a60ed1cba29bd3bd4095c405f67f380a296dc3bea3f812c4402",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7b9ffe1b033510fe013fe3001d04c222bba0de4e98b5481dc1b63664a4ebc4c",
      "text": "摇滚音乐节当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3391f2ee43b87dcaf61f73bab46c903b2ae86d2ab3f355ec14ecb220e725f0ef",
      "text": "哎呀，离音乐节开始还有挺长时间呢，\n翔太居然没在打瞌睡，真罕见啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b172a2cacaede45351c0e6839e67d4cc6afea6b261e15c548186c02d7d54e742",
      "text": "那当然啦！\n今天的我可不一样哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27d3638e0a6ca119db6327e7b3c7d49d7da505c19cabd1c5a96b1f65bf9cb11c",
      "text": "嘴上这么说，别整个人趴在桌子上啊！\n真是的，到底有没有紧张感啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9373bc3274139f1da729d1bd6eb5873df0127012685574f0d446ea5afdc3e68c",
      "text": "讨厌啦，冬马君。\n开个玩笑而已嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8905beb45540a7906bd28f857351320d82f8fab35ecfb5f0f3ec1c52e6e9d5e",
      "text": "哟，Jupiter的各位。\n今天请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:905d1011723e530b563b07fe82bf93bac8f7ce62db2ccb9e77aeea5e5de8f7c9",
      "text": "我们才要请您多多关照。\n一起轰轰烈烈地大干一场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bee6b6b4c57467d61f96dc1643d0ddd2506292de680f13b93cd7f00b1e8d4175",
      "text": "说什么大干一场啊。\n净会说大话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9e3836b743c20cc6cacf5a5d234120eaeb926e9ca18cbb3bfe44f4294bd3a2",
      "text": "！你这家伙是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7436562ac12174da4621114652fc84aee97f59eee0e9e4a7eb344c5c41083853",
      "text": "……这里可是摇滚的盛典。就凭你们这种\n不温不火的小偶像能干得了什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc304726dc61c71d0c105ec72aa1b62d539317dde01782e2cb8d31552ba4e1bc",
      "text": "趁着还没丢脸赶紧滚回家去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eaf443ac38c938fa1562a64a7da6e1a3999c7bac008ce58abba2d9cb48b216e",
      "text": "我们可不是来玩的。\n是为了打倒你们才来到这里的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea099d1cae4bff0a4540a468dd843d40932b28d59964032635d072fa7d54880f",
      "text": "听好了，给我约好了。如果我们赢了……\n就把那个Livehouse还回来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33a06698d63eb48aed54dc267a3d2485c5b5a3173da12d023e1ada4ddbe47295",
      "text": "哈，口气倒挺大的嘛。\n办得到的话你们就试试看啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
